{"title":"Goodnight Punpun","overview":"This is Punpun’s coming-of-age story. His parents’ marriage is falling apart. His dad goes to jail, and his mom goes to the hospital. Punpun has to live with his loser uncle. He has a crush on a girl who lives in a weird cult. He tries talking with God about his problems, but God is a jerk. Punpun keeps hoping things will get better, but they really, really don’t.\n\n*Source: VIZ Media*","year":2007,"status":"ended","genres":["Comedy","Drama","Fantasy","Mature","Psychological","Romance","School Life","Seinen","Slice of Life","Supernatural","Tragedy"],"rating":8.8,"seriesType":"manga","metadata":{"images":[{"coverType":"poster","url":"/demo/MediaCover/2eff84db-0ac0-883b-9b7a-7953c17008bc/poster-f361a45997.jpg","remoteUrl":"https://images.mangabaka.dev/f/1/3/c/1/2/9/5/c455/4d7f/a3a5/9c071e72fdfb"}],"creators":[{"name":"Inio Asano","roles":["storyAndArt"]}],"externalLinks":[{"name":"MangaBaka","externalId":"1357","url":"https://mangabaka.org/manga/1357/Goodnight-Punpun","relationshipType":1},{"name":"Grand Comics Database","externalId":"75954","url":"https://www.comics.org/series/75954/","relationshipType":1},{"name":"Grand Comics Database","externalId":"76236","url":"https://www.comics.org/series/76236/","relationshipType":1},{"name":"Grand Comics Database","externalId":"84626","url":"https://www.comics.org/series/84626/","relationshipType":1},{"name":"AniList","externalId":"34632","url":"https://anilist.co/manga/34632","relationshipType":1},{"name":"Big Comics","externalId":"ed6abb572575e","url":"https://bigcomics.jp/series/ed6abb572575e","relationshipType":0},{"name":"Wikipedia EN","externalId":"Goodnight_Punpun","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Goodnight_Punpun","relationshipType":0},{"name":"Wikipedia","externalId":"おやすみプンプン","url":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E3%81%8A%E3%82%84%E3%81%99%E3%81%BF%E3%83%97%E3%83%B3%E3%83%97%E3%83%B3","relationshipType":0},{"name":"Kitsu","externalId":"9964","url":"https://kitsu.io/manga